   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility stu Land Adm</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xF6;rstudie Lantm&#xE4;tar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida har gett uppdraget till Swedesurvey att genomf&#xF6;ra en f&#xF6;rstudie med m&#xE5;ls&#xE4;ttningen att bed&#xF6;ma behov och relevans f&#xF6;r st&#xF6;d av Lantm&#xE4;tar sektorn i Kroatien samt Justitieministeriets samt den Geodetiska institutionens kapacitet och kompetens samt ange geneerlla f&#xF6;ruts&#xE4;ttningar f&#xF6;r institutions samarbete.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida will commission Swedesurvey to carry out a feasibility study with the objective to assess the Land Administration and Cadastre secorin Croatia including capacity of the Ministry of Justice and State Geodetic Administration as well as the general preconditions for institutional capacity building co-operation.</narrative>
  </description>
